      "message": "Can we rearrange this change in a way that we don\u0027t have to do much when removing the flags?\nI was thinking of rearranging it like this\n\n```\nvoid hidh_l2cif_disconnect(uint16_t cid) {\n  L2CA_DisconnectReq(cid);\n  \n  if (!flag) {\n    disconnect_continue(cid);\n  }\n}\n\nvoid hidh_l2cif_disconnect_continue(uint16_t cid) {\n  // if cid is interrupt channel, disconnect control channel\n  // else conclude disconnection request\n}\n\nvoid hidh_l2cif_disconnect_cfm(uint16_t cid, uint16_t result) {\n  if (!flag) {\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  disconnect_continue(cid);\n}\n```",
